From 2e729de9938016f4dce58e9fc75e964b001d1f97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:44:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(test): set pass_start in the playback bench params

The #3355 field is new on OpParams::Adaptive2D. The playback bench
built the variant from scratch, so clippy --all-targets refused it.
The quick gate builds only the test targets that its diff picks, so
it did not see this file. Set the field to the default (Auto), as
the other full initializers in the tests do.

Refs #3355

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
